", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f3b2ee0e063d92567d0"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f3b2ee0e063d92567d1", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0dfa3"], "topics": ["60e2fb7b66f9ce3f243b5123"], "concepts": ["60e2fb7a66f9ce3f243b5100"], "question": {"text": "Team <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>A</mi><none></none><mo>&#39;</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mo>&#39;</mo></mmultiscripts></math> consists of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> boys and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> girls and Team <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>B</mi><none></none><mo>&#39;</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mo>&#39;</mo></mmultiscripts></math> has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> boys and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> girls. If a total of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>52</mn></math> single matches can be arranged between these two teams when a boy plays against a boy and a girl plays against a girl, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is equal to:"}, "options": [{"id": "7580bd", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f3b2ee0e063d92567d2"}, {"id": "8f8c2b", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f3b2ee0e063d92567d3"}, {"id": "1ecaf2", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f3b2ee0e063d92567d4"}, {"id": "c6c318", "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f3b2ee0e063d92567d5"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f3b2ee0e063d92567d6", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["